@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram
hide footbox
actor User
participant system

User -> system : 1. Inserts account details\n(email and password)
system -> system: 1.1 Checks if credentials are valid

alt Credentials  valid : True
    system --> User : returns success

else Credentials valid : False
    system --> User : returns failure
end

@enduml